Modifications: fill="currentColor" is replaced with #ffffff so the icons can be
tinted at paint time. duo/<name>.svg holds only the opacity="0.2" back layer of
duotone/<name>-duotone.svg, with the opacity attribute removed.

regular/mt-*.svg and duo/mt-*.svg are original MasterTech glyphs drawn on the
same 256 grid and stroke weight.
